{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aDream Abyss: Survivors\u300b</strong> is a <strong>roguelike action RPG</strong> infused with anime-style visuals and \u201cbullet heaven\u201d gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Lily</strong>, a brave girl diving into a surreal dreamworld to rescue her sister <strong>Lumi</strong>, lost in the depths of a nightmare.<br>As you progress through the stages, <strong>story events unfold</strong>, and you\u2019ll <strong>meet allies and unlock new playable characters</strong> along your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf00 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four Playable Anime-Style Heroines</strong><br>Each with unique fighting styles, exclusive skills, and beautifully crafted 3D models.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/Animation_1.gif?t=1745938080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Six Stages Featuring Towns and Dungeons</strong><br>Explore distinct environments filled with secrets, story, and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels: Easy / Nightmare / Hell</strong> <br>Whether you're a beginner or a hardcore survivor, challenge awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/2.png?t=1745938080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Variety with Deep Progression Systems</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 - 24 Exclusive Skills + 17 Shared Skills = 41 total skills to mix and match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 - 38 Enhancement Cards and 26 Stat Boosts to create your own builds each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/Animation_3.gif?t=1745938080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/Animation_3b.gif?t=1745938080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylish 2D Sprite Animation for Enemies and Bosses</strong><br>Each stage includes 4~6 types of monsters, 3 mid-bosses, and a powerful final boss.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/Animation_4.gif?t=1745938080\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Massive Replayability with 243 Achievements</strong><br>Test your skill and unlock everything the abyss has to offer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636470?t=1745938080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636470?t=1745938080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/778cec5d5ec74a96621300ff0b6cdaa70866261b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745938080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/778cec5d5ec74a96621300ff0b6cdaa70866261b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745938080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aDream Abyss: Survivors\u300b</strong> is a <strong>roguel